  <item>
    <title>125 魔改烂片OR经典神作？趣话《倚天屠龙记之魔教教主》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af1a0b85b7c4709bfe37731</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af1a0b85b7c4709bfe37731</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《倚天屠龙记之魔教教主》是1993年12月上映的由王晶导演，李连杰、邱淑贞、张敏、黎姿、洪金宝、吴镇宇主演的一部经典香港武侠片。1993年真是中国电影史上一个佳作频出的年份，无论是中国大陆还是香港地区，都涌现出许多至今仍被奉为经典的作品。比如《霸王别姬》《唐伯虎点秋香》《东成西就》《黄飞鸿之狮王争霸》《太极张三丰》《东方不败之风云再起》《青蛇》《方世玉》……</span></p><p><span>《倚天屠龙记之魔教教主》到底是魔改烂片还是经典神作？这期节目，就让我们一起畅聊这部上映30多年，话题性依然很高的武侠电影~</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>舟舟</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>剑兄 鸿鸣</span></p><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a> 观感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">00:10:56</a> 开场旁白好不好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">00:23:06</a> 张三丰改编成功吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">00:36:32</a> 张翠山自尽和殷素素遗言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">00:41:58</a> 论“一柱擎天”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">00:51:01</a> 周芷若的人设改编好坏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">00:56:50</a> 小昭摘下面纱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">01:02:02</a> 九阳神功速通改编好坏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4223">01:10:23</a> 白衣赵敏出场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4681">01:18:01</a> 配乐好坏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5045">01:24:05</a> 磕头得秘籍合理吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5773">01:36:13</a> 周芷若二次被黑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5995">01:39:55</a> 张无忌当上了教主</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6959">01:55:59</a> 与赵敏交锋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8143">02:15:43</a> 现场教拳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8439">02:20:39</a> 为什么后两部胎死腹中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8790">02:26:30</a> 结束</span></p><p><strong><span>策划：</span></strong><span>剑兄</span></p><p><strong><span>后期：</span></strong><span>鸿鸣</span></p><p><strong><span>封面：</span></strong><span>舟舟</span></p><p><span>「纸醉金迷FM」是两个金迷朋友创办的播客。我们希望以金庸为起点，畅聊那些广受欢迎的文艺作品，表达生活意见。每月10日、20日、30日定期更新，欢迎订阅~</span></p>]]></description>
