    <title>112 从《武林外传》李大嘴状元骗局，看中国式母子的爱与执念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5c80e16356eb2d9be4e0b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5c80e16356eb2d9be4e0b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>同福客栈集体飙戏，只为圆一个厨子的“武状元”梦。本期我们一起聊聊《武林外传》中“李厨子智斗瞎老娘”这回故事，聊聊这段既荒诞又温情、既好笑又好哭的剧情~</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>小路</span></p><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>剑兄 鸿鸣 &nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">00:01:05</a> 大嘴的借口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">00:05:15</a> 老白的评书和小郭的厨艺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">00:12:30</a> 如何用嘴造出一个京城</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">00:24:46</a> 老白评书之校场风云</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">00:30:57</a> 主播经历之拾金不昧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">00:36:34</a> 皇上驾到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">00:45:00</a> 老太太知道真相了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3239">00:53:59</a> 好汉饶命</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">00:57:50</a> 结束</span></p><p><strong><span>策划：</span></strong><span>剑兄</span></p><p><strong><span>后期：</span></strong><span>鸿鸣</span></p><p><span>「纸醉金迷FM」是两个金迷朋友创办的播客。我们希望以金庸为起点，畅聊那些广受欢迎的文艺作品，表达生活意见。每月10日、20日、30日定期更新，欢迎订阅~</span></p>]]></description>
